# AdaLanguage plugin + Ada String data formatters.
#
# A dedicated lldb_private::Language plugin for Ada (DW_LANG_Ada83/95/2005/2012)
# with two hardcoded summaries that render GNAT strings as quoted text:
#   * unconstrained String -- the fat-pointer record {P_ARRAY, P_BOUNDS},
#     reading the LB0..UB0 byte range;
#   * constrained String -- a fixed-length array of Character stored inline.
# Both restrict to single-byte character elements so non-character arrays fall
# through to default rendering. Auto-registers via the PLUGIN cmake keyword +
# LLDB_PLUGIN_DEFINE. With TypeSystemAda reporting eLanguageTypeAda* natively,
# these summaries are consulted through the normal Ada formatter path.
